   "block": "movies.dlg24",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "You could just turn them on for everyone. Lots of younger people use them anyway, so he won't feel singled out.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait a second, that's sweet. What else?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 2.72,
   "block": "movies.dlg24",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_16",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Some TVs connect to wireless headphones, so he can have his own volume while everyone else listens normally.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "movies.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, he'd like that. He",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
